<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-ASTRA GRAPHIA FIRST-HALF NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ASTRA GRAPHIA FIRST-HALF NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			     (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 5.84	 vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)  89	   vs     130</p>
<p>    Net sales			520.65	vs    405.09</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   100.10	vs     78.57</p>
<p>    Operating profit		29.73	vs     23.51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   9.34	vs	9.96</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     19.41	vs     10.82</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Astra Graphia is an information technology distributor.</p>
